294
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:07,940
that sincere look in your eyes while you shove your burdens onto everyone else

295
00:15:07,940 --> 00:15:10,160
how was i supposed to know that

296
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,860
you don't ever talk

297
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:13,040
heck you don't even eat

298
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:15,380
what's the point did you even having a mouth at all

299
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:18,200
shut up you fool

300
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:21,600
you haven't even put in half the effort marsil does each day

301
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,600
i really don't think now's the time for this

302
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,280
what a childish squabble

303
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:28,460
