307
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:36,900
the gnom and i could each revive half

308
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:38,540
but there isn't enough blood left

309
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:39,720
senshi

310
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:42,160
