311
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,200
will do

312
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,560
if needed

313
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:46,620
i can cast a simple revival

314
00:15:46,620 --> 00:15:48,300
no that will not be necessary

315
00:15:48,300 --> 00:15:54,780
