316
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:57,420
cast anything strange and i will cut you down

317
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:24,420
you see ishiro

318
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:27,980
guess who's stronger because they've been eating proper daily meals

319
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:29,000
it's me

320
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,280
c-curses

321
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:46,280
tasty

322
00:16:46,280 --> 00:16:48,400
my lord

323
00:16:48,400 --> 00:16:50,020
everyone has been revived

324
00:16:50,020 --> 00:16:52,940
