she'll find her way back if she wants to

331
00:17:05,100 --> 00:17:07,140
we're deeply sorry my lord

332
00:17:07,140 --> 00:17:08,500
we weren't strong enough

333
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:09,520
no

334
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:12,280
i know you all did your very best

335
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:13,840
thank you

336
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:16,580
