338
00:17:22,820 --> 00:17:25,700
i won't be coming back to this island

339
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:28,360
once on the surface

340
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:30,360
i'll report to the island lord

341
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,920
i see

342
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:35,620
i'd planned to return with felon

343
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:37,800
