344
00:17:37,800 --> 00:17:39,500
i don't know

345
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:43,100
she asked for some time to think about it

346
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:45,320
so i've been waiting

347
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:56,580
i've never met a woman as fascinating as her

348
00:17:56,580 --> 00:17:59,680
i love her voice

349
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,560
the way she thinks

350
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:04,780
her beautiful smile

351
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:09,480
the unfortunate thing is

352
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:12,120
i never told her exactly how i felt

353
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:15,040
i wish i would have told her sooner

354
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:17,040
what

355
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:18,820
he proposed out of nowhere

356
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:19,700
how bizarre

357
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:22,380
