358
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:23,660
don't you worry

359
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:25,660
i'll make sure to tell her for you

360
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:31,240
it's this side of you laios

361
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:34,700
that i envy

362
00:18:34,700 --> 00:18:38,900
hey uh

363
00:18:38,900 --> 00:18:40,980
you were a huge help in all this

364
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:42,640
no not really

365
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,620
my last attack was meaningless

366
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:47,820
no i was able to learn several things because of it

367
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:48,560
you were

368
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:52,100
each of the places you stabbed would have been fatal for a human

369
00:18:52,100 --> 00:18:54,080
but that wasn't the case for my sister

370
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:57,700
which means either those areas don't have vital organs

371
00:18:57,700 --> 00:18:59,280
or there are multiple of them

372
00:18:59,280 --> 00:19:01,860
there are lots of monsters like basilisks

373
00:19:01,860 --> 00:19:04,400
cerberus and psyllas that have multiple brains

374
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:06,500
it's common for chimera types

375
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:09,880
he looks so excited right now

376
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:12,380
guess he really does like monsters

377
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:14,360
is this knowledge his weapon

378
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:17,140
he says he'll defeat the mad mage

379
00:19:17,140 --> 00:19:19,640
there are definitely people who come into the dungeon

380
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:21,080
who are more skilled than him

381
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:23,900
but they don't have the same motivation and knowledge he does

382
00:19:23,900 --> 00:19:25,340
i think she hesitated

383
00:19:25,340 --> 00:19:27,240
i honestly believe he can accomplish it

384
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:29,220
although

385
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:32,400
what's gonna happen after he does

386
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:35,280
whoever manages to defeat the mad mage

387
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:37,280
