393
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:55,400
hey are you hungry

394
00:19:55,400 --> 00:20:18,060
what even is this

395
00:20:18,060 --> 00:20:20,360
it's samago yaki made from some harpy eggs

396
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:24,700
senshi found a few a little while ago

397
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:27,480
you said you were interested in monster cuisine right

398
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,700
you should try one

399
00:20:28,700 --> 00:20:37,380
