402
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:42,980
kill

403
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:44,560
no i can't

404
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:45,580
thanks leos

405
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:46,740
of course

406
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:50,140
he'll do literally anything just to get on someone's good side

407
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:51,900
this guy's amazing

408
00:20:51,900 --> 00:21:07,580
preparations for the returning spell are now complete

409
00:21:07,580 --> 00:21:09,700
is anyone still injured

410
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:11,520
