414
00:21:19,100 --> 00:21:21,840
but if you do manage to survive

415
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:25,680
and you cannot return to the surface because of the black magic

416
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:27,760
ring the spell

417
00:21:27,760 --> 00:21:30,860
it will resonate with its twin from anywhere

418
00:21:30,860 --> 00:21:32,460
