419
00:21:32,460 --> 00:21:35,520
i'll send one of my people to help you flee to the east

420
00:21:35,520 --> 00:21:37,940
don't die

421
00:21:37,940 --> 00:21:40,940
thank you

422
00:21:40,940 --> 00:21:43,380
leos

423
00:21:43,380 --> 00:21:44,920
i'm glad that we met

424
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:47,240
